<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <main>
    <div style="background-color: var(--bg-card); padding: 60px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
      <div class="container text-center">
        <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 20px;">Careers & Learning</h1>
        <p class="text-muted" style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.1rem;">
          The cyber security field is growing rapidly with zero percent unemployment. Discover career paths, certifications, and resources to start your journey.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mt-4 mb-4">
      <h2 class="mb-4" style="color: var(--accent-green);">Common Roles</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Security Analyst (SOC)</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-2">Monitors network traffic, analyzes security alerts, and responds to incidents in real-time.</p>
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; background: var(--border-color); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px;">Entry to Mid-Level</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Ethical Hacker / Pentester</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-2">Proactively attempts to breach systems (with permission) to find and fix vulnerabilities before malicious hackers do.</p>
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; background: var(--border-color); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px;">Mid to Senior-Level</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Security Engineer</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-2">Designs and builds secure IT infrastructure, implements firewalls, and maintains security systems.</p>
          <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; background: var(--border-color); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px;">Mid to Senior-Level</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="mt-4 mb-4" style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Top Certifications</h2>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan);">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">CompTIA Security+</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">The global standard for validating baseline skills to perform core security functions. Great for beginners.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-green);">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">CEH (Certified Ethical Hacker)</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">Certifies individuals in the specific network security discipline of Ethical Hacking from a vendor-neutral perspective.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #ef4444;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">OSCP (Offensive Security Certified Professional)</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">A highly respected, entirely hands-on penetration testing certification. Not for the faint of heart.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #eab308;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">CISSP</h3>
          <p class="text-muted">The gold standard for security management professionals. Requires 5 years of proven industry experience.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
